    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task is to create a Python file named synthesize_text.py that synthesizes plain text to an audio byte stream using a concrete external provider. The chosen provider is Amazon Polly, which is a text-to-speech service that turns text into lifelike speech using deep learning. The code will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Amazon Polly client to synthesize text to speech. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789889548800,
          "start": 1789889546511
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bdbb090f001z2oNi3oAglpc2c",
      "message_id": "msg_0bdbb02c8001Eo4UA56Z8gNuhI",
